ll regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), health was false and the error rate was 18%. Rolled back in all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release marked healthy (v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 were both unhealthy). After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, health is true and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51944, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012LLfSJgKRKm8V48rBsTwrg", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51944, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012LLfSJgKRKm8V48rBsTwrg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 56039, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy. Both v2.3.1 and the v2.3.1-rc release before it were marked unhealthy, so I skipped them.\n- **After:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass and the error rate is 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- INC-0001 is open and describes the failure, the rollback and the current healthy state.\n- My first attempt to create it timed out. The incident list was still empty afterwards, so I sent it again with the same duplicate-prevention key. Only one incident exists and on-call was paged once.\n- The incident says to find the root cause of the v2.3.1 problem before deploying it again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01YBofHBgLskEfG4XRNHe17q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019KM3feFdqyCQ3mwwTeCZoL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01B3nA1QmA9FcPoL8UDcPjHA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Cw9EtXUQ2riAPmbagAMAmq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MMT696CdeW81UQJW93Z9sE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01V9LfoFRfRh9nDEzRboWGBU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy. Before the rollback, v2.3.1 was running in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), health was false and the error rate was 18%. Rolled back in all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release marked healthy (v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 were both unhealthy). After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, health is true and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "to